{
    "version": "0.0.3-main-48ee9306fd14",
    "description": "Lightweight native Windows terminal: PuTTY's pterm with ConPTY built in. Nightly build from main.",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/xiongnemo/nemoterm",
    "license": "MIT",
    "notes": [
        "This is a prerelease built from main; there is no stable nemoterm yet.",
        "Start it with nemoterm, or nt for short (like Windows Terminal's wt). The Start menu has a Nemoterm shortcut.",
        "Settings are kept in the registry, under HKCU\\Software\\Nemo\\Nemoterm, apart from PuTTY's. Uninstalling leaves them; to remove them as well, run: reg delete HKCU\\Software\\Nemo\\Nemoterm /f",
        "The arm64 build does not offer the WSL Linux PTY option yet: its helper is built for x86-64 Linux only. WSL still runs, through ConPTY.",
        "Known issues: https://github.com/xiongnemo/nemoterm/blob/main/docs/KNOWN_ISSUES.md"
    ],
